  notes: "Covers: monthly 甲 withholding by the electronic computation rule (電算機計算の特例), monthly 乙 by the official 月額表, bonus withholding by the official rate table with the 月額表 exceptions (NTA 2523, previous calendar month's pay read with regular_in_month), health insurance (協会けんぽ by prefecture, or a 健康保険組合 with entity rates), nursing care for ages 40 to 64 from the birth date, 子ども・子育て支援金 on its own line, employees pension 18.3 percent with the standard monthly remuneration (profile) and standard bonus caps, employment insurance by business type and wage closing date, and resident tax as two profile amounts. Run kinds: regular pay, final pay (termination) and extra pay in the month (off-cycle; payroll recomputes corrections with the original kind) all get employment insurance on their wages and 源泉 on the month's salary less tax already withheld this month; bonuses get bonus premiums and bonus tax; reimbursement runs get nothing. Coverage months: a premium is deducted only for a month the employee was insured (資格取得 month up to the month before 資格喪失, the day after the last day; 同月得喪 owes the month), so a new hire's first pay under 翌月徴収 carries none, and a premium month is deducted once per pay month (info line JP_PREM_MONTH); leaving at a month end under 翌月徴収, the final pay also carries that month (前月及びその月, 健康保険法 167条, info line JP_PREM_FINAL). Final pay adds the resident tax lump sum up to May for January to April leavers (and on request otherwise). Unused leave settled on leaving (LEAVE_EXIT) is left out of 給与, insurance and employment insurance with a warning (jp_exit_leave_classify): no official source on its classification was read this session; it is usually 退職所得 when paid because of retirement, which this pack does not compute. Rounding of employee shares: 50 sen or less dropped, over 50 sen raised (協会けんぽ table note); the same rule is applied to employment insurance. Not covered: year-end adjustment (pack jp-yea), 日額表 pay (weekly, daily, semi-monthly), retirement income (退職所得: do not tag severance jp_taxable), 子ども・子育て拠出金 (employer only, not on payslips), workers accident insurance (employer only), 定額減税 style credits, part-time coverage tests, the pension refund rule for 同月得喪. The age checks at 70 and 75 are warnings: turn the insured flags off when coverage ends. 令和9年分 withholding tables (pay from 1 January 2027, including the 1 percent defence surtax inside the unchanged 102.1 percent). Social insurance uses 令和8年度 rates, which run to February 2027 premiums: premiums from March 2027 and employment insurance from 1 April 2027 raise a blocker until a new version adds the FY2027 rates. The pension grade 33 (680,000 yen) from September 2027 is not included.",
